Metric:
Pred prop:
  (at-location loader location): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (available mill): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (busy mill): in_pre in_eff
  (change-process brand brand): in_init in_pre
  (connected location location): in_init in_pre
