Func prop:
  (capacity crane): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_int in_pre on_num_op_rhs write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
  (has-resource raw-cane mill): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_int in_pre in_eff rhs_funcs:(max-produce)
  (in-storage location brand): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_int in_pre in_goal in_eff rhs_funcs:(capacity max-produce)
  (in-truck-sugar brand truck): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_pre in_eff rhs_funcs:(capacity)
